<title>UK: SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NORTHERN IRISH PREMIER DIVISION RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BELFAST 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Northern Irish premier</p>
<p>division soccer matches on Saturday:</p>
<p> Ards	    2  Portadown  3</p>
<p> Cliftonville  0  Coleraine  1</p>
<p> Glenavon	2  Glentoran  1</p>
<p> Linfield	0  Crusaders  1</p>
<p>Standings (tabulated under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, against, points):</p>
<p> Coleraine     2   2   0   0   2   0   6</p>
<p> Glenavon	2   1   1   0   4   3   4</p>
<p> Portadown     2   1   1   0   3   2   4</p>
<p> Crusaders     2   1   1   0   3   2   4</p>
<p> Glentoran     2   0   1   1   2   3   1</p>
<p> Cliftonville  2   0   1   1   1   2   1</p>
<p> Linfield	2   0   1   1   0   1   1</p>
<p> Ards	    2   0   0   2   2   4   0</p>
